><span begin="1:30.390" end="1:30.652">を</span><span begin="1:30.652" end="1:31.414">咥</span><span begin="1:31.414" end="1:31.751">え</span><span begin="1:31.813" end="1:32.411">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离群索居 叼起梦想</span></p><p begin="1:33.013" end="1:38.987" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.013" end="1:33.271">そ</span><span begin="1:33.271" end="1:33.529">れ</span><span begin="1:33.529" end="1:33.789">が</span><span begin="1:33.789" end="1:34.634">最</span><span begin="1:34.634" end="1:35.033">後</span><span begin="1:35.033" end="1:35.567">に</span><span begin="1:36.240" end="1:36.471">な</span><span begin="1:36.471" end="1:36.701">る</span><span begin="1:36.701" end="1:37.070">気</span><span begin="1:37.070" end="1:37.351">が</span><span begin="1:37.351" end="1:37.776">し</span><span begin="1:37.839" end="1:38.041">た</span><span begin="1:38.041" end="1:38.243">ん</span><span begin="1:38.243" end="1:38.899">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总觉得那是最后一次了</span></p></div><div begin="1:39.408" end="1:52.483" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:39.408" end="1:45.467" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.408" end="1:40.239">獣</span><span begin="1:40.239" end="1:40.568">は</span><span begin="1:40.568" end="1:41.412">砂</span><span begin="1:41.412" end="1:42.141">を</span><span begin="1:42.616" end="1:43.177">一</span><span begin="1:43.177" end="1:43.931">握</span><span begin="1:43.931" end="1:44.172">り</span><span begin="1:44.267" end="1:44.644">撒い</span><span begin="1:44.644" end="1:45.298">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">野兽撒下一把沙尘</span></p><p begin="1:45.760" end="1:52.483" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.760" end="1:46.031">そ</span><span begin="1:46.031" end="1:46.303">れ</span><span begin="1:46.303" end="1:46.574">が</span><span begin="1:46.574" end="1:47.454">最</span><span begin="1:47.454" end="1:47.855">後</span><span begin="1:47.855" end="1:48.522">に</spa